omes a pure diffuse light. When not baking emission, this can be used to avoid unrealistic reflections when placing lights above an emissive surface."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftgodot\/light3d\/lightspecular","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"lightSpecular","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"lightSpecular","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/Light3D\/lightSpecular","type":"topic"},"doc://SwiftGodot/documentation/SwiftGodot/Light3D/lightEnergy":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiftgodot\/light3d\/lightenergy","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/Light3D\/lightEnergy","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"lightEnergy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The light’s strength multiplier (this is not a physical unit). For "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/OmniLight3D","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/SpotLight3D","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", changing this value will only change the light color’s intensity, not the light’s radius."}],"title":"lightEnergy"},"doc://SwiftGodot/documentation/SwiftGodot/SpotLight3D":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SpotLight3D","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A spotlight, such as a reflector spotlight or a lantern."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SpotLight3D","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"SpotLight3D","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/SpotLight3D","role":"symbol","url":"